    "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Comparing both sides, we get,&nbsp;<br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />So the system of equation has non-zero solution<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1<